# 📊 Business Insights & Strategic Recommendations
## Amazon Brazil E-Commerce Analytics | MySQL Project

### Project Overview

This project analyzes Brazilian e-commerce transactional data to uncover insights into seller performance, customer purchasing behavior, product revenue, payment preferences, delivery efficiency, and customer satisfaction.

Using MySQL, 14 business questions were analyzed to support decision-making across logistics, marketing, finance, merchandising, customer relationship management, and marketplace operations.

The primary objective was to transform transactional data into actionable business intelligence.

