# 2. Seller Performance & Fulfillment Operations

## Q1. Regional Seller Fulfillment Performance

### Key Findings

| Seller State | Recorded Fulfillment Activity |
|---|---:|
| São Paulo (SP) | 78,604 |
| Minas Gerais (MG) | 8,603 |
| Paraná (PR) | 8,487 |
| Rio de Janeiro (RJ) | 4,685 |
| Santa Catarina (SC) | 4,000 |

### Business Insight

São Paulo dominates seller-side fulfillment activity.

The substantial difference between São Paulo and other states indicates a high concentration of marketplace supply-side operations.

This may reflect a large seller base, higher seller transaction activity, or both.

### Strategic Recommendations

- Assess warehouse capacity and transportation infrastructure in São Paulo.
- Evaluate whether logistics partnerships in Minas Gerais and Paraná could support more balanced regional distribution.
- Compare seller locations with customer delivery destinations to identify potential shipping inefficiencies.
- Monitor delivery delays and transportation costs across high-volume seller states.

**Expected Business Impact:** More informed regional fulfillment planning and potential improvements in logistics efficiency.

